  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Game::Game.Dialogue.TextDialogueNode
  text: Go on, then, friend, tell him. A new face nobody knows against a Company guard with a key he's allowed to carry? Nobody's going to believe you. And the men who buy that grain remember faces, so think about who'll be walking behind you after dark.
